[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3120.47, "timestamp": "00:52:00", "text": "我拿走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3121.75, "timestamp": "00:52:01", "text": "不，不，拿着吧。拿着吧。拿着吧。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3127.19, "timestamp": "00:52:07", "text": "美好的。看到了这些阴影。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3130.23, "timestamp": "00:52:10", "text": "嗯，我觉得他拿到了那把剑。得到一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3132.71, "timestamp": "00:52:12", "text": "分钟。有大把时间可以玩乐。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3134.79, "timestamp": "00:52:14", "text": "我们排在前三名。哇哦。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3141.109, "timestamp": "00:52:21", "text": "所以，现在我们在队伍后方等待。我们 我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3144.39, "timestamp": "00:52:24", "text": "可能得走到这堵墙前去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3148.71, "timestamp": "00:52:28", "text": "但如果我们挺身而出，我们就会一直等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3150.47, "timestamp": "00:52:30", "text": "直到他们开始打架，然后我们就走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3153.19, "timestamp": "00:52:33", "text": "当他们开始打架的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3155.19, "timestamp": "00:52:35", "text": "他们正在战斗。那么，我们现在就走。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3158.23, "timestamp": "00:52:38", "text": "于是，我们进去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3159.51, "timestamp": "00:52:39", "text": "所以，我们就等着他们打起来，或者我们"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3168.133, "timestamp": "00:52:48", "author": "@Totembtw", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hioaXnlAE2bO9zkq1LR7obAzNHeT2CyJQVDqLyLs1xpQtflZ50pJJfeodntXZC_QCm0VDoyEgA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ello joq"}]